<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 127-5 AT CLOSE V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 127-5 AT CLOSE V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa, chasing a victory target of 461, were 127 for five in their second innings at close of play on the fourth day of the third and final cricket test against India at Kanpur on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 237 and 400-7 declared (M.Azharuddin 163 not out, R.Dravid 56), South Africa 177 and 127-5 (H.Cronje 50).</p>
